# Fail-closed build context: only bytes explicitly consumed by the ClayVerse image
# are sent to the Docker/OCI builder. Local state, credentials, receipts, tests,
# VCS metadata and unrelated research material stay outside the build context.
*
!Dockerfile
!requirements.txt
!SOURCE_LOCK.json
!build/
!build/install_pinned_xterm.py
!build/install_pinned_claude.py
!clayverse/
!clayverse/**
# Retired public/alternate product surfaces stay as repository evidence/tests but never
# enter the final image. The final internal Mistral acceptance path intentionally keeps
# adapters.py + engine.py + inference_protocol.py because final_acceptance_probe.py
# imports them to run cognition through the canonical UnifiedDB/EffectGate spine.
clayverse/api.py
clayverse/terminal.py
!policy/
!policy/**
!runtime_CLAUDE.md
!entityos.lock.json
!EntityOS
